OL,3,GNEWSA#1,400-a-week care home rated
OL,4,Ainadequate by CQC
OL,5,
OL,6,FA care home in Norfolk promising
OL,7,F"elegant luxury living" has been rated
OL,8,Fas inadequate after its first
OL,9,Finspection.
OL,11,FKings Court Care Home in Holt - where
OL,12,Froom fees start at #1,400 per week -
OL,13,Fhas been placed in special measures by
OL,14,Fthe Care Quality Commission (CQC)
OL,15,Ffollowing the visit in July.
OL,17,FInspectors criticised the leadership,
OL,18,Fthe reliance on agency staff and the
OL,19,Fconsistency of care.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
