OL,3,GNEWSA#1,400-a-week care home rated
OL,4,Ainadequate by CQC
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for its operator,
OL,7,FKingsley Healthcare Group (KHG), said
OL,8,Fstaffing changes had been made and that
OL,9,Fit "apologises unreservedly to
OL,10,Fresidents and families for the
OL,11,Fshortfalls identified".
